  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EVERWIND/MP_EVERWIND_Header.webp\" width=\"2347\" height=\"862\"></strong></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Everwind 是一款中世纪风格的整合包，灵感源自新作《Everwind》——一个由浮空岛、古老地牢和巨龙构成的世界。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">踏入这片高魔奇幻世界，天空中弥漫着神秘气息，每座浮岛都蕴藏着等待探索的新挑战、宝藏与故事。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>准备好在最佳服务器托管平台上与好友一同游玩了吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EVERWIND/MP_EVERWIND_Promo.webp\" width=\"2347\" height=\"348\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我推荐<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a>与好友联机，因为其提供高质量且无延迟的服务器。您可以无缝安装任何 CurseForge 整合包或自定义模组，且不会出错。此外，他们的客服团队全天候在线，随时为您解决任何问题。使用我的优惠码<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>可享购买立减 25%</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EVERWIND/MP_EVERWIND_Description.webp\" width=\"2347\" height=\"232\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🗺️ <strong>探索与建筑</strong><br>搭载 <em>Explorify</em>、<em>Towns &amp; Towers</em> 和 <em>Medieval Buildings</em>，世界中遍布着浮空村落、古代遗迹与时光掩埋的城堡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🐉 <strong>巨龙与神话生物</strong><br><em>Ice and Fire: Dragons</em> 与 <em>Naturalist</em> 让这个世界充满生机，飞行巨兽与野生奇遇触手可及。猎杀它们、驯服它们 &mdash; 或在它们的烈焰前逃窜。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⚔️ <strong>流畅动态的战斗</strong><br><em>Better Combat</em> 与 <em>Fantasy Weapons &amp; Armor</em> 全面革新战斗系统，让每一次挥砍与闪避都极具响应感与打击力。翻滚、格挡、重击，在史诗般的战斗中开辟道路。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🔮 <strong>天界领域</strong><br>借助 <em>The Aether</em> 与 <em>Deep Aether</em> 穿越云层，探索充满遗迹、地牢与天堂风光的全新维度。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">💀 <strong>地牢与挑战</strong><br><em>Dungeon Crawl</em>、<em>Illager Invasion</em> 和 <em>Better Archeology</em> 为浮空世界增添了隐藏的遗迹、要塞与首领，静候勇者前来发掘。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🏗️ <strong>沉浸式建造与设计</strong><br><em>Conquest Reforged</em>、<em>Diagonal Walls</em>、<em>Medieval Paintings</em> 与 <em>Immersive Lanterns</em> 助您打造真正的中世纪建筑 &mdash; 连接浮岛的桥梁、天空堡垒或小型空中农场。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌄 <strong>氛围与音效</strong><br><em>AmbientSounds</em>、<em>Visuality</em>、<em>Presence Footsteps</em> 与 <em>Medieval Music</em> 营造出充满生机的沉浸环境，风声与天际的遥远回响交织其中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🤝 <strong>多人联机优化</strong><br>专为服务器与小型社区设计，运行流畅。模组群确保稳定的多人游戏体验，实现战斗、探索与世界生成的同步。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EVERWIND/MP_EVERWIND_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1691\" height=\"167\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/416/everwind-1.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/420/everwind-5.png\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/422/everwind7.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X4BEeSByGU\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EVERWIND/MP_EVERWIND_Discord.webp\" width=\"2347\" height=\"232\"></a></strong></p>",
